{"lines": ["Start with Monoun. On the fifteenth of August, 1984, at about ten thirty at night, residents heard a loud noise. Between roughly three in the morning and dawn, thirty-seven people in the low-lying area died.", "The skin of some victims was damaged, and that detail is still not fully explained.", "At the time, it was a mystery. Terrorism was suspected.", "Now the second lake. Nyos, high in the north-west of Cameroon, is a deep crater lake on the flank of an inactive volcano. Under it, a pocket of magma leaks carbon dioxide into the water.", "On the twenty-first of August, 1986, that gas came out all at once. Somewhere between one hundred thousand and three hundred thousand tons of carbon dioxide. A cloud moving at nearly a hundred kilometres an hour, spilling over the lip of the lake and down the valleys toward the villages of Cha, Nyos and Subum.", "It displaced the air. Carbon dioxide is heavy, and it does not announce itself. It killed one thousand seven hundred and forty-six people within twenty-five kilometres, and three thousand five hundred livestock.", "Rule one. When the dead have no wounds, check the air before you chase the story."], "words": [["Start", 0.0, 0.22], ["with", 0.22, 0.4], ["Monoun.", 0.4, 1.56], ["On", 1.56, 1.64], ["the", 1.64, 1.707], ["fifteenth", 1.707, 1.773], ["of", 1.773, 1.84], ["August,", 1.84, 2.44], ["1984,", 2.44, 3.38], ["at", 4.06, 4.14], ["about", 4.14, 4.3], ["ten", 4.3, 4.64], ["thirty", 4.64, 4.98], ["at", 4.98, 5.18], ["night,", 5.18, 5.4], ["residents", 6.06, 6.11], ["heard", 6.11, 6.42], ["a", 6.42, 6.58], ["loud", 6.58, 6.8], ["noise.", 6.8, 7.18], ["Between", 8.02, 8.07], ["roughly", 8.07, 8.28], ["three", 8.28, 8.68], ["in", 8.68, 8.8], ["the", 8.8, 8.88], ["morning", 8.88, 9.1], ["and", 9.1, 9.28], ["dawn,", 9.28, 9.5], ["thirty-seven", 9.5, 10.04], ["people", 10.04, 10.68], ["in", 10.68, 10.88], ["the", 10.88, 10.98], ["low-lying", 10.98, 11.42], ["area", 11.42, 11.74], ["died.", 11.74, 12.18], ["The", 13